                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-05"><hi rendition="#italic">December 5,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Presented your request Hidalgo case. Awaiting answer.</p>
